Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:15.17,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a story about love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The princess of a certain country fell in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:23.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The person she fell in love\Nwith was the castle cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Theirs was a love between\Npeople of different social classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,This is off topic, but why\Ndo we say "{\i1}fall {\i0}in love"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it because one falls into it unexpectedly\Nand suddenly, like a pitfall trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Not that I would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:41.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The two of them nurtured their love secretly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,and in time, the princess became pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.21,0:00:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was the fruit of\Ntheir love, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:31.96,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Princess Without Subjects"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,This place is in ruins...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there was a war or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:59.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anything about that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:08.13,Main,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single person here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, this is a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if I head to another town now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I probably won't get there\Nuntil the middle of the night...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll freeze...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the only place that\Nlooks like it's still standing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like no one's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I am very reluctant to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.58,Main,,0,0,0,,but I have to do what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Please excuse the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:14.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel alive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It was cold outside, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I didn't think anyone lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't think anyone would come here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.58,0:05:26.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:29.79,Main,,0,0,0,,From a faraway, distant land.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:32.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:34.54,Main,,0,0,0,,May I ask your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Elaina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,My name is Mirarosé.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:48.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirarosé, what happened to this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.46,0:05:50.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:51.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:58.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened\Nto this town, or why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:02.46,Main,,0,0,0,,When I woke up, I found myself in\Nthis country that was already in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:08.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But you remember your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:26.63,Main,,0,0,0,,"You who are reading this\Nare the princess, Mirarosé."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:31.58,Main,,0,0,0,,You're living in a room like this in the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,so I guess it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,"Why are you here? Why is the country in ruins?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Why have you lost your memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I will explain a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:48.13,Main,,0,0,0,,If you do not want to die, then read this."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:50.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoever wrote this seems pretty self-important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like the sun has set.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.83,0:06:57.42,Main,,0,0,0,,"By the way, is it night where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:59.88,Main,,0,0,0,,If so, then I'd like you\Nto look out the window."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.88,0:07:01.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Out the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:27.88,Main,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Continue reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.25,0:07:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,"That monster is the demon\Nthat destroyed the country
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,and the cause of your amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:38.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The monster's name is Javalier."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.88,0:07:43.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that... Javalier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:46.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The next part of the letter says,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:51.17,Main,,0,0,0,,"Awakening as the sun sets,\Ndestroying the country until the sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:55.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Javalier's goal is to annihilate\Neveryone in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:59.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It is going wild looking for the last person--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:01.67,Main,,0,0,0,,in other words, you."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:07.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Javalier is trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:11.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, why don't you leave this\Ncountry and go somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.54,0:08:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,"This castle is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.33,0:08:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Javalier cannot enter this castle."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:18.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,"Javalier is after you, she who has\Nbecome a princess without subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:29.21,Main,,0,0,0,,If you leave this country,\Nthen Javalier will chase you," it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.21,0:08:31.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And then finally, it says,\N"I'd like to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.75,0:08:33.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I want you to kill Javalier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:39.13,Main,,0,0,0,,As a witch, you should have enough\Npower to easily defeat Javalier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:42.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, for our sake, in order for you to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,and for the sake of those\Nunfortunate enough to be killed."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.00,0:08:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're a witch, Mirarosé?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:57.25,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're a witch, too, Elaina?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:09:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That should've been obvious by my appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.38,0:09:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I have my brooch on, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,But that letter leaves a lot of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did Javalier appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:17.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Why were you the only one\Nto survive and lose your memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:19.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't say anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:26.21,Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm the princess, and this country\Nwas destroyed by that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:29.04,Main,,0,0,0,,So, I have a duty to defeat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,How many days have you seen that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the seventh day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.25,0:09:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you ever fought it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.63,0:09:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But, I will fight it tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:46.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you have any chance of winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You seem very confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been one week since I woke up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:57.33,Main,,0,0,0,,and I finally remembered how to use magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:10:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's possible that before I lost\Nmy memory, I was pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Moreover, my magic has been recharged.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:11.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I will be cheering you on from a safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, you won't help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.67,0:10:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Will I gain anything by helping you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:22.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't dislike your honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:32.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, Mirarosé let me use\Na room once used by a castle servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:35.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so fluffy and warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mirarosé!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:15.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Something smells good...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.71,0:11:24.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:27.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Morning. These just finished baking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Where'd they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I baked them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You can bake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:34.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but my\Nbody just seems to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:43.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's eat while they're still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.21,0:11:48.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you listen to me talk\Nwhile we eat? About tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll be fighting Javalier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to help me prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.67,0:12:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You let me spend the night\Nand even made breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I can at least help with your preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, will you help me fight Javalier?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.04,0:12:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:25.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, if this place is safe,\Nlike the letter says,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,then don't you have the choice of not fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose the letter's\Ncredibility is also questionable, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,The resentment the writer of\Nthat letter felt for Javalier is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:40.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.79,0:12:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.54,0:12:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,"I hate Javalier so much. I want to kill it."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I can feel that hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And for some reason, I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:20.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'll finish by nightfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.17,0:13:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What does "finish" mean in this case?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see. I think you're maybe halfway done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I might die first...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirarosé's plan is to trick\NJavalier into falling into the hole
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,and then attack with magic\Nafter it is unable to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:38.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if just prevents a counterattack,\Nit could be very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The flaw in this plan is that\Nthe preparations are a huge pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:51.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is nothing! I'm the Ashen Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:52.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a trifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.75,0:14:03.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us meet again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:06.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll treat you to a delicious dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:12.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It will be a lot of work for you\Nto cook after finishing a big job,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:14.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I will cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:17.79,Main,,0,0,0,,So please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I ended up coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.83,0:15:06.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though I only met her yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but feel\Nlike I wanted her to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:15.13,Main,,0,0,0,,So I will fight with her, too.\NWithout putting my life in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:26.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Come now, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:59.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Come here, Javalier!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:08.33,Main,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.08,Main,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:23.46,Main,,0,0,0,,She's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:26.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe I won't need to do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.54,0:17:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirarosé!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.83,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's how it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:09.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That's amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.63,0:19:24.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Well? Do you understand my despair now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:35.17,Main,,0,0,0,,...Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I got my memories back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:56.29,Main,,0,0,0,,All of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.21,0:20:21.04,Main,,0,0,0,,She told her father, the king, about how\Nshe had become pregnant with the cook's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.04,0:20:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,This is what the king said:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.46,Main,,0,0,0,,"He will be executed."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:31.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The king would not allow their\Nlove that crossed class and rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,The cook underwent cruel torture,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.54,0:20:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,and was burned to death in front of her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And the child, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I swore
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.83,0:20:47.25,Main,,0,0,0,,that I would kill everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:51.79,Main,,0,0,0,,First, in order to make\Nthis castle a safe place,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:54.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I put up a barrier that only let mages in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.79,0:20:59.17,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why Javalier\Ncouldn't get into the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:05.25,Main,,0,0,0,,And then, I left myself a letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:08.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and cursed my father,\Nturning him into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.13,0:21:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,In exchange, I lost my memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:16.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Your father, Javalier, destroyed\Nthe country and its people...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.83,0:21:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, he ate them himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that, he did it while\Nstill aware that he was the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:29.96,Main,,0,0,0,,That monster ate the subjects\Nwhether the king wished to or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That should have made\Nhim understand how it felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.46,0:21:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,...to have the things dear to\Nyou snatched away from you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,To understand that despair...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, the bread's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,It's time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:00.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:10.13,Main,,0,0,0,,How is it? Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It can't compare to the bread you bake, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat more?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, you've got jam on your cheek.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,In this way, the curtain\Nfell on the "love story"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:35.79,Main,,0,0,0,,that all went according to her plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.92,Main,,0,0,0,,She became the princess\Nwithout subjects by her own hand...
